	(text "ESP-01 (ESP8266) on RP2350B UART1: GPIO36 = UART1 TX -> URXD, GPIO37 = UART1 RX <- UTXD\nGPIO38 -> RST and GPIO39 -> GPIO0 (via R12/R13 100R on the RP2350B sheet) let firmware reset and reflash the ESP\nR38/R39 4.7K pull-ups win over the RP2350 default pad pull-downs at power-up (normal boot)\nC53/C54 at the module VCC pin: ESP8266 TX bursts draw ~300 mA\nPCB: keep copper (all layers) out from under the antenna end of the module"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
